<title>USA: U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. soybean meal major sales activity in the week ended Oct 10 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:     1996/97		 1997/98</p>
<p> China	   167,000-A		Nil</p>
<p> Dominican Rep  28,300</p>
<p> Lebanon	  17,200</p>
<p> Venezuela	17,100</p>
<p>A-includes new sales of 112,000 tonnes and 55,000 tonnes switched from unknown.</p>
<p>Exports 25,400 tonnes were 38 percent below the previous week and 66 percent below the four-week average. Major export destinations were Canada (11,300) and Colombia (4,600).</p>
</text>
